@startuml
title Expense Creation and Approval

|Swing client|
start
:Enter expense, payer, participants,
 split, and optional receipt;
:Submit to service API;

|Service|
:Authenticate account;
:Authorize current group membership;
if (Valid members, amount, and split?) then (yes)
  :Calculate exact shares with
  largest-remainder allocation;
  |Receipt storage|
  :Validate and store optional image
  privately before linking;
  |PostgreSQL and receipt store|
  :Transactionally persist PENDING
  expense, shares, receipt reference,
  and in-app notifications;
  |Service|
  :Return pending expense;
else (no)
  :Return clear validation/authorization error;
  stop
endif

|Reviewer client|
:Open pending expense details;
:Submit approve or reject;

|Service|
:Check current reviewer permission;
if (Authorized reviewer?) then (yes)
  |PostgreSQL|
  :Conditionally transition only
  PENDING expense and record decision;
  if (Transition succeeds?) then (yes)
    if (Decision is approve?) then (yes)
      :Commit APPROVED state;
      note right
        Approved shares become inputs
        to derived balances.
      end note
    else (no)
      :Commit REJECTED state;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Return conflict; no second effect;
  endif
else (no)
  |Service|
  :Deny without changing state or balance;
endif
stop
@enduml
